<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Tests 1 to 11 are incorrect because they don't provide UTF-8. Replace

&lt;c&gt;
is truncate_utf8($in, ...), "...";
&lt;/c&gt;

with

&lt;c&gt;
is truncate_utf8(encode_utf8($in), ...), encode_utf8("...");
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
